<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Linking <span id="id1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2E75B6;">Perception</span>, <span id="id2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFC000;">Confidence</span> and <span id="id3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#548235;">Accuracy</span> in MLLMs</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
